WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.728 --> 00:00:16.447
Zoom! Roxy shot toward the bus.

2
00:00:16.447 --> 00:00:19.373
"It's Rocket Girl!" cried Jack.

3
00:00:19.373 --> 00:00:23.671
"I can't believe Roxy is missing this!" said Terrell.

4
00:00:23.671 --> 00:00:27.976
"Hang on, everyone!" Roxy called to the scared passengers.

5
00:00:27.977 --> 00:00:31.436
Gripping the bus, Roxy flew up into the air.

6
00:00:31.436 --> 00:00:34.644
The Ultra Car zoomed by below her.

7
00:00:34.645 --> 00:00:36.950
"Whew!" said Roxy.

8
00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:40.062
Everyone on the bus cheered.

9
00:00:40.062 --> 00:00:45.471
Roxy carried the bus to its next stop. She set it down.

10
00:00:45.472 --> 00:00:48.380
"Thanks, Rocket Girl!" said the bus driver.

11
00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:50.687
"You're welcome!" called Roxy.

12
00:00:50.687 --> 00:00:53.050
She flew into the air again.

13
00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:56.426
"I have to stop the Ultra Car," she thought.

14
00:00:56.426 --> 00:01:00.035
"Ruby can't control it!"

15
00:01:00.035 --> 00:01:05.190
Suddenly—whoosh! The Ultra Car flew past Roxy.

16
00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:10.129
"Uh-oh!" cried Roxy. "I forgot that car could fly!"

17
00:01:10.129 --> 00:01:13.600
Roxy flew after the flying car.

18
00:01:13.601 --> 00:01:17.403
Ruby screamed. "Save me, Rocket Girl!"

19
00:01:17.404 --> 00:01:20.510
Ruby pressed buttons and flipped switches.

20
00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:22.301
But the car kept going.

21
00:01:22.301 --> 00:01:26.042
Zap! Zap! Lasers fired.

22
00:01:26.042 --> 00:01:28.856
Roxy dodged them.

23
00:01:28.856 --> 00:01:31.340
The Ultra Car dived down.

24
00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:34.752
Splash! It plunged into the river.

25
00:01:34.753 --> 00:01:37.509
Then the car popped out of the water.

26
00:01:37.509 --> 00:01:39.454
Now it was a boat!

27
00:01:39.454 --> 00:01:42.147
It glided fast over the water.

28
00:01:42.148 --> 00:01:45.057
Roxy flew fast too.

29
00:01:45.057 --> 00:01:47.662
She grabbed the car's roof.

30
00:01:47.662 --> 00:01:52.086
Roxy used her super strength to pull off the roof. Rip!

31
00:01:52.086 --> 00:01:54.792
"Yay!" shouted Ruby.

32
00:01:54.793 --> 00:01:57.453
Roxy pulled Ruby from the stolen car.

33
00:01:57.453 --> 00:02:00.793
Next Roxy used her heat vision.

34
00:02:00.794 --> 00:02:04.113
Orange beams melted the car's control panel.

35
00:02:04.114 --> 00:02:07.941
The Ultra Car slowed down and then bobbed in the water.

36
00:02:07.941 --> 00:02:11.673
Ruby grinned. "Thank you, Rocket Girl."

37
00:02:11.673 --> 00:02:15.901
Roxy frowned. "You caused a lot of damage, Ruby."

38
00:02:15.901 --> 00:02:20.307
"Did I?" Ruby glanced around.

39
00:02:20.307 --> 00:02:26.623
"Oh well. Mother will pay someone to fix everything."

40
00:02:26.623 --> 00:02:29.370
Roxy picked up the car with one hand.

41
00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:31.853
She carried Ruby with the other.

42
00:02:31.853 --> 00:02:36.720
She flew back to the car show.

43
00:02:36.721 --> 00:02:39.578
"Hello, Mother," said Ruby.

44
00:02:39.578 --> 00:02:42.273
"Your favorite daughter is safe.

45
00:02:42.273 --> 00:02:45.919
Rocket Girl was kind enough to save me."

46
00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:49.947
Mrs. Cash dabbed her eyes with the handkerchief again.

47
00:02:49.948 --> 00:02:58.140
"Thank you, Rocket Girl! Thank you for saving my daughter!"

48
00:02:58.141 --> 00:03:01.786
Later Roxy and her friends were at Mara's house.

49
00:03:01.786 --> 00:03:04.590
They were playing video games.

50
00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:08.458
"You missed all the fun today, Roxy," said Jack.

51
00:03:08.458 --> 00:03:12.627
"We flew through the air in a bus!" said Mara.

52
00:03:12.628 --> 00:03:14.985
Roxy pretended to be surprised.

53
00:03:14.985 --> 00:03:17.681
"Wow! How did that happen?"

54
00:03:17.682 --> 00:03:21.907
Terrell grinned. "Rocket Girl carried the bus through the air.

55
00:03:21.907 --> 00:03:25.190
I told you she could help us fly!"

56
00:03:25.190 --> 00:03:27.892
"It was awesome!"

57
00:03:27.892 --> 00:03:32.326
Jack threw up his hands and dropped his controller. "Oops!"

58
00:03:32.326 --> 00:03:35.925
Everyone laughed.

59
00:03:35.925 --> 00:03:42.860
"Good thing Rocket Girl didn't drop your bus!" said Roxy.
